   "text": "Your first week. New boss. And he only speaks Italian.",
   "url": "file:///home/claude/v4/a/16_n1.mp3",
   "who": "n"
  },
  {
   "text": "Senti... stasera chiudi tu?",
   "url": "file:///home/claude/v4/a/16_b1.mp3",
   "who": "b"
  },
  {
   "text": "You understood... nothing.",
   "url": "file:///home/claude/v4/a/16_n2.mp3",
   "who": "n"
  },
  {
   "text": "Ehm... scusi... il bagno?",
   "url": "file:///home/claude/v4/a/16_p1.mp3",
   "who": "p"
  },
  {
   "text": "Classic.",
   "url": "file:///home/claude/v4/a/16_n3.mp3",
   "who": "n"
  },
  {
   "text": "But your course is built around this job. So today's lesson...",
   "url": "file:///home/claude/v4/a/16_n4.mp3",
   "who": "n"
  },
  {
   "text": "...is literally closing up for the night.",
   "url": "file:///home/claude/v4/a/16_n5.mp3",
   "who": "n"
  },
  {
   "text": "Chiudere: to close. Stasera: tonight.",
   "url": "file:///home/claude/v4/a/16_n6.mp3",
   "who": "n"
  },
  {
   "text": "Certo! Stasera chiudo il ristorante.",
